---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About - Artists Are Jerks" bodyClass="about-page">
  <article class="about-page-body">
    <h1>About Artists Are Jerks</h1>

    <p>I wanted to be a fine artist. I went to art school, just not the right one, and then I ran into the art world: the galleries that take almost no one, the right schools, the right rooms, the right people. I didn't get through those doors. So I did what a lot of artists do and made a turn. I became an illustrator, then a graphic designer, then a packaging designer, and I spent decades making a good living making things people looked at.</p>

    <p>Along the way I met every kind of jerk the art world has to offer. For a while, I was one. That guy still shows up now and then. So I know the games from both sides.</p>

    <p>Here's what I learned: most artists want to be discovered by a gallery, and they should. Representation is still the big prize, and it's worth reaching for. But getting there takes years, and in the meantime you need to be seen. There are far more places to be seen than the art world admits: the café, the brewpub, the bookstore, the artist's own studio. Local musicians figured this out a long time ago. You don't sit around waiting for the record deal. You play the bar down the street, people come, and that's how you build toward the deal. Even artists who land a gallery keep playing those rooms.</p>

    <p>That's what this site is for. It's a calendar of where to go see real art by local artists, in person, this week. It won't get you past the barriers, but it'll tell you what to expect from them, and it's a door that's already open.</p>

    <p class="signature">I'm Alan Just. <a href="https://alanjust.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More about me<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span> →</a></p>

    <div class="actions">
      <a class="action action--primary" href="/showing-now/">See what's showing now</a>
      <a class="action" href="/join/?kind=artist">Show your work</a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <style>
    .about-page-body { max-width: var(--max-width-reading); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-12); color: var(--color-black); }
    .about-page-body h1 { margin: 0 0 var(--space-5); text-align: center; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: var(--font-size-4xl); line-height: var(--line-height-tight); }
    .about-page-body p { margin: 0 0 var(--space-4); font-size: var(--font-size-lg); line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed); }
    .signature { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold); }
    .signature a { color: var(--color-purple); }
    .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-3); margin-top: var(--space-6); }
    .action { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: 1 1 12rem; min-height: 44px; padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-5); background: var(--color-cream); border: var(--border-base) solid var(--color-black); border-radius: var(--radius-full); color: var(--color-black); font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold); text-decoration: none; }
    .action--primary { background: var(--color-black); color: var(--color-gold); }
    .action:hover, .action:focus-visible { background: var(--color-purple); color: var(--color-gold); }
    @media (min-width: 900px) {
      .about-page-body h1 { font-size: var(--font-size-5xl); }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
